---
// LandingV3ValueStackSection.astro — ancoraggio valore/prezzo (€3.200 → €1.300 → risparmio)
---
<section id="valore-prezzo" class="py-12 bg-white" aria-labelledby="valore-title">
  <div class="container mx-auto px-4">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
      <aside class="bg-green-50 border-2 border-green-security p-8 rounded-2xl text-center card-shadow">
        <h2 id="valore-title" class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-blue-navy mb-2">Quanto vale e quanto paghi</h2>
        <p class="text-dark-gray mb-6">Un servizio legale completo a compenso fisso, che paghi solo a risultato — dopo la convalida.</p>
        <div class="landing-v3-value-grid">
          <div>
            <div class="landing-v3-value-num" style="color:var(--blue-navy)">€3.200</div>
            <div class="text-sm text-dark-gray">Valore dei servizi professionali</div>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="landing-v3-value-num" style="color:var(--green-security)">€1.300</div>
            <div class="text-sm text-dark-gray">Prezzo fisso (paghi dopo la convalida)</div>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="landing-v3-value-num" style="color:var(--gold-refined)">€1.900</div>
            <div class="text-sm text-dark-gray">Il tuo risparmio</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <a href="#form-rapido" class="btn-primary px-8 py-4 rounded-lg font-bold btn-mobile-fix" style="margin-top:1.5rem;">Richiedi una valutazione</a>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
